=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaotic Physics: Help each other or make things harder for one another.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/30b2f2c5bfe415239ed65e21e27036b0.poster.avif?t=1785344027\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/30b2f2c5bfe415239ed65e21e27036b0.webm?t=1785344027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/30b2f2c5bfe415239ed65e21e27036b0.mp4?t=1785344027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vertical World: Smooth movement mechanics based on climbing, sliding, and dodging.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/6c511d0e53b237c838f1421f5a20894e.poster.avif?t=1785344027\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/6c511d0e53b237c838f1421f5a20894e.webm?t=1785344027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/6c511d0e53b237c838f1421f5a20894e.mp4?t=1785344027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dangerous Flora: Unpredictable plants and rock enemies that react to sound and touch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/2303b290e4d2785012ee54fac238df22.poster.avif?t=1785344027\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/2303b290e4d2785012ee54fac238df22.webm?t=1785344027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alien Technology: Vital gear like Jetpack, Gravity Gun, Headlight, and Teleporter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/f79e4e12d424a1f4639352cf9a650dee.poster.avif?t=1785344027\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/extras/f79e4e12d424a1f4639352cf9a650dee.webm?t=1785344027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nitrogen Management: Not oxygen, Nitrogen! Manage the air you breathe carefully, or you’ll suffocate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Signal Quest: Constantly aim higher to climb and return home.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Stranded on a mysterious alien planet, you must survive, explore and ascend a colossal planetary fault line in search of a signal that could lead you home. Use advanced alien technology, overcome hostile ecosystems, and choose whether to cooperate with your teammates, or leave them behind!", "supported_languages": "English, Turkish, Azerbaijani, Japanese, Russian, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Bulgarian, Danish, Indonesian, Dutch, Finnish, Traditional Chinese, Korean, Spanish - Latin America, Polish, Hungarian, Norwegian, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Thai, Ukrainian, Vietnamese, Greek, Czech, Swedish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970800/e8c65504ca6e7a3c9aded723fcd2b4613fce7053/header.jpg?t=1785344027", "capsule_image": "htt